<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114167" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλο-άζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλόη</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be bright green,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				846b13
			</span></i>: esp. of plants, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.517d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				11.18.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χλοάζον πᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					3.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sprout, bud,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				576
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρμα παρ᾽ ἀτραπιτοῖσι
			χλοάζον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				917
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>feed on grass,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hippiatr.
				97
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτι χλοαζούσας αὐλητρίδας</span>
			<i>budding,</i> cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χνο-</span> in
				<i><span class="en">
				Metag.
				4.3
			</span></i> (hex.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
